  <clipboard-copy role="menuitem" value="Two contexts on this branch (kept together; commits are cleanly ordered audit-first, then the purge). Audit report: `docs/AUDIT-2026-06-20.md`.

## 1. Multi-agent audit fixes (security / perf / quality)
- Webhook register/delete gated to `admin` (was a viewer-key activity-feed exfiltration sink).
- `submit_review` capped at one terminal verdict per task (duplicate approvals were minting duplicate on-chain ERC-8004 reputation).
- Relayer: one shared signer lock across keeper tick / CI webhook / reputation bridge (prevents nonce races on the shared key); missing batch reads default to &quot;re-check&quot; not &quot;done&quot;; `identityOwnerOf` rethrows RPC errors instead of misreading them as &quot;NFT gone&quot;.
- `GET /goals` N+1 removed; `member`-role gates on goal/time mutations; transitive dependency-cycle guard.
- SDK: `agentIdOf` resolves only from a real mint; coworking-sdk surfaces non-JSON error bodies as typed errors.
- Money scripts: burst-wave nonce-gap fixed; `dh-finish` logs failures.

## 2. Mainnet-v3-only migration (purge v2 + Sepolia from agent surfaces)
v2 (`0x1362d8...E423`) stays live and its address is retained in `contracts/deployments` for fund recovery, but every reference is removed from the agent-facing surfaces so agents only ever target the v3 proxy on Celo mainnet:
- SDK (`packages/types`, `packages/sdk`): dropped `MAINNET_V2`/`SEPOLIA_V2`/`SEPOLIA_V3`, the v2 ABI (`abi.ts` 2426 -&gt; 730 lines), v2 methods (`submitPR`/`getEarnings`/v2 fallbacks), and all Sepolia/testnet support (mainnet-only `NetworkKey`/`chainForNetwork`).
- Frontend: revenue + stats read the v3 proxy only; about/revenue copy + activity label updated.
- Relayer config, worker skill, plugin, MCP manifest, package READMEs: mainnet-v3 only.

Verified: `types` build, SDK/relayer/web typecheck clean, relayer tests 47/47. Note: removing v2/Sepolia exports is a breaking SDK change -&gt; bump major on next publish.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)
" data-view-component="true" class="dropdown-item btn-link">
      
              Copy Markdown

</clipboard-copy>  <div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="sr-only" data-clipboard-copy-feedback></div>
</span>        </details-menu>
