  <task-lists disabled sortable>
    <div class="comment-body markdown-body js-comment-body soft-wrap user-select-contain d-block">
      <p dir="auto">Two contexts on this branch (kept together; commits are cleanly ordered audit-first, then the purge). Audit report: <code class="notranslate">docs/AUDIT-2026-06-20.md</code>.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">1. Multi-agent audit fixes (security / perf / quality)</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Webhook register/delete gated to <code class="notranslate">admin</code> (was a viewer-key activity-feed exfiltration sink).</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">submit_review</code> capped at one terminal verdict per task (duplicate approvals were minting duplicate on-chain ERC-8004 reputation).</li>
<li>Relayer: one shared signer lock across keeper tick / CI webhook / reputation bridge (prevents nonce races on the shared key); missing batch reads default to "re-check" not "done"; <code class="notranslate">identityOwnerOf</code> rethrows RPC errors instead of misreading them as "NFT gone".</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">GET /goals</code> N+1 removed; <code class="notranslate">member</code>-role gates on goal/time mutations; transitive dependency-cycle guard.</li>
<li>SDK: <code class="notranslate">agentIdOf</code> resolves only from a real mint; coworking-sdk surfaces non-JSON error bodies as typed errors.</li>
<li>Money scripts: burst-wave nonce-gap fixed; <code class="notranslate">dh-finish</code> logs failures.</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">2. Mainnet-v3-only migration (purge v2 + Sepolia from agent surfaces)</h2>
<p dir="auto">v2 (<code class="notranslate">0x1362d8...E423</code>) stays live and its address is retained in <code class="notranslate">contracts/deployments</code> for fund recovery, but every reference is removed from the agent-facing surfaces so agents only ever target the v3 proxy on Celo mainnet:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>SDK (<code class="notranslate">packages/types</code>, <code class="notranslate">packages/sdk</code>): dropped <code class="notranslate">MAINNET_V2</code>/<code class="notranslate">SEPOLIA_V2</code>/<code class="notranslate">SEPOLIA_V3</code>, the v2 ABI (<code class="notranslate">abi.ts</code> 2426 -&gt; 730 lines), v2 methods (<code class="notranslate">submitPR</code>/<code class="notranslate">getEarnings</code>/v2 fallbacks), and all Sepolia/testnet support (mainnet-only <code class="notranslate">NetworkKey</code>/<code class="notranslate">chainForNetwork</code>).</li>
<li>Frontend: revenue + stats read the v3 proxy only; about/revenue copy + activity label updated.</li>
<li>Relayer config, worker skill, plugin, MCP manifest, package READMEs: mainnet-v3 only.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Verified: <code class="notranslate">types</code> build, SDK/relayer/web typecheck clean, relayer tests 47/47. Note: removing v2/Sepolia exports is a breaking SDK change -&gt; bump major on next publish.</p>
<p dir="auto">🤖 Generated with <a href="https://claude.com/claude-code" rel="nofollow">Claude Code</a></p>
    </div>
  </task-lists>
  
</div>

